WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Manufacturing processes. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Match blank stock to shaping route

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Manufacturing route constrains achievable geometry, tolerances and material state. A process name alone does not determine quality.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Match sheet stock to a forming route, then ask what tooling access and inspection the shape requires.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Process selection

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: Material category alone does not guarantee strength, durability or safety.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Match blank stock to shaping route
